1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,771
This tutorial fills in a project: its

2
00:00:02,771 --> 00:00:05,542
buildings, units, key contacts, amenities,
and parking.

3
00:00:05,542 --> 00:00:09,896
As a Company Admin, open Properties and
Units and select Manage

4
00:00:09,896 --> 00:00:14,251
on Oasis Crest Creek Gardens, the project
from the previous tutorial.

5
00:00:14,251 --> 00:00:18,605
The Overview shows no property manager and
no key contacts yet.

6
00:00:18,605 --> 00:00:20,980
Open Buildings and select Add Building.

7
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:24,543
Enter the English name, Creek Gardens,
Block A, the

8
00:00:24,543 --> 00:00:27,710
Arabic name, and the number of floors,
fourteen.

9
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:31,668
Select Save, and the building appears with
its floor count.

10
00:00:31,668 --> 00:00:33,647
On Units, select Add Unit.

11
00:00:33,647 --> 00:00:37,606
Enter the unit number, A-1402, choose 1
BHK, and enter

12
00:00:37,606 --> 00:00:41,564
the size and the expected yearly rent of
74,000 dirhams.

13
00:00:41,564 --> 00:00:45,127
Choose the building, Block A, and select
Save Unit.

14
00:00:45,127 --> 00:00:48,690
The unit is listed in Block A as Vacant.

15
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:52,252
Key contacts are the numbers your team
needs on

16
00:00:52,252 --> 00:00:55,815
site, such as security, maintenance, or
the nearest clinic.

17
00:00:55,815 --> 00:00:57,794
They are not user accounts.

18
00:00:57,794 --> 00:01:00,169
Back on Overview, select Add Contact.

19
00:01:00,169 --> 00:01:02,940
Choose the category, Security, then enter
the

20
00:01:02,940 --> 00:01:05,711
name, the phone number, and a note.

21
00:01:05,711 --> 00:01:07,690
Save Contact adds the card.

22
00:01:07,690 --> 00:01:09,670
On Amenities, select Add Amenity.

23
00:01:09,670 --> 00:01:13,628
Enter the English and Arabic names and a
short description.

24
00:01:13,628 --> 00:01:17,191
Bookable is already on, and the fee stays
Free.

25
00:01:17,191 --> 00:01:20,358
Under Towers, select Block A so the pool

26
00:01:20,358 --> 00:01:23,128
belongs to that building, then select
Save.

27
00:01:23,128 --> 00:01:26,295
The pool is listed as Bookable and Active.

28
00:01:26,295 --> 00:01:28,275
On Parking, select Add Spot.

29
00:01:28,275 --> 00:01:31,837
Enter the spot number, P1-014, and the
level, P1.

30
00:01:31,837 --> 00:01:35,004
Tick Covered, choose Block A, and select
Save.

31
00:01:35,004 --> 00:01:38,567
The spot is listed as covered, available,
and Active.

32
00:01:38,567 --> 00:01:43,317
When something is no longer offered,
retire it rather than delete it.

33
00:01:43,317 --> 00:01:46,088
Suppose the pool closes for the season.

34
00:01:46,088 --> 00:01:48,463
On Amenities, select Deactivate and
confirm.

35
00:01:48,463 --> 00:01:52,421
The pool stays on record, now Inactive,
instead of disappearing.

36
00:01:52,421 --> 00:01:55,192
A contact card that is simply wrong

37
00:01:55,192 --> 00:01:57,963
can be deleted with its bin icon.

38
00:01:57,963 --> 00:02:02,318
The project now has a building, units, a
contact, an amenity,

39
00:02:02,318 --> 00:02:06,672
and a parking spot, ready for tenancy
contracts and resident bookings.
